+is five bytes versus true's four. The prior all-cap component was one byte short
+for ordinary operations, even where other current first-path padding covered the
+total. The new test independently builds the symbolic component from descriptor
+limits and verifies both boolean widths against the held source component. This
+is not an invented native business state. The full future seven-pin reserve must
